DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260725T203000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260725T233000
DTSTAMP:20260720T173009Z
URL:https://jackofthewood.com/events/greenwood-rye/
SUMMARY:Greenwood Rye
DESCRIPTION:\nGreenwood Rye is a modern jam-grass band\, formed in Nashvill
 e as the house band for the award-winning bluegrass supper club\, Jane's H
 ideaway. Led by Shawn Spencer (Seven Handle Circus) on Guitar and Vocals\,
  the band 's main cast features Ruth Shumway (Fiddle\, Vocals)\, David Fre
 eman (Mandolin\, Vocals)\, Taylor Shuck (Banjo) &amp\; Andy Brown (Upright
  Bass).\n\n\n\nThe group writes fun\, modern songs that are rooted in blue
 grass\, throwing in some jam-band tendencies\, and an occasional kick-drum
  or delay pedal.&nbsp\; And they love performing fresh renditions of eclec
 tic covers of all genres done with the beautiful sounds of acoustic bluegr
 ass instruments.\n\n\n\nTheir latest album\, "Hideaway" had a single\, "Do
 wn to the River" debuted by Bluegrass Situation and two singles placed on 
 Spotify's Official Editorial "New Grass" Playlist.&nbsp\; The album that w
 as released just last August already has over 370k Spotify streams.\n\n\n\
 nRecently they have been venturing further and further from Nashville\, pl
 aying on festivals such as ROMP\, Americanafest\, Official IBMA Showcase\,
  Albino Skunk and a slew of other small festivals\, clubs\, events and hou
 se concerts.&nbsp\;\n\n\n\nCurrently they are in residence at The Countryp
 olitan in Nashville\, where they play every week for locals and tourists f
 rom across the country who come to Nashville looking for a great\, authent
 ic music experience.&nbsp\;\n\n\n\nThe residency also features regular gue
 st appearances by some of Nashville’s greatest young bluegrass players i
 ncluding Frank Evans (Bronwyn Keith-Hines\, Slocan Ramblers)\, Sasha Ostro
 vsky (Darius Rucker)\, Josey Toney(Haily Whitters)\, Josh Rilko (Sierra Fe
 rrell\, Lindsey Lou)\, Oliver Craven (Stray Birds\, Sierra Ferrell)\, Alex
  Genova (Fireside Collective\, Jason Carter) Tony Aichelle (Travis Tritt\,
  Morgan Wallen)\, Larry Cook (Tony Trishka)\, Brenna MacMillan Ben Plotnic
 k on Fiddle\, Mandolin\, Bass\, Dobro\, and Banjo.&nbsp\;\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\
 nhttps://youtu.be/ooWKbLbheXw?feature=shared\n\n\n\n\n\nhttps://youtu.be/e
 TK3JfROi_c?feature=shared\n\n\n\n\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jackofthewood.com/wp-content/uploads/202
 6/04/07-25-26_GreenwoodRye_IG_1080x1440.jpg
END:VEVENT
