DESCRIPTION:You are cordially invited to join us for a potluck dinner on S
 unday evening\, July 26 at Groce United Methodist Church. This event is in
 spired by the sense of community that many of us experienced in the afterm
 ath of Helene. We gathered to share supplies and food and stories\, and in
  the process sometimes came to know our neighbors better than we had previ
 ously. However\, once our power and water came back online that feeling in
 evitably faded. To keep that spark of community alive\, the Haw Creek Comm
 unity Association has hosted several potluck dinners this year. We decided
  to make this a regular event based on the terrific participation and posi
 tive responses we've gotten. Every resident of Haw...
