X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Little Jumbo": "https://www.littlejumbobar.com/events/2008/kinetic-earth-will-boyd-kevin-spears", "Where Y'at AVL Music": "https://www.littlejumbobar.com/events/2008/kinetic-earth-will-boyd-kevin-spears"}
