X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Little Jumbo": "https://www.littlejumbobar.com/events/1908/benevolent-order-of-the-creature-lodge-no-241", "Where Y'at AVL Music": "https://www.littlejumbobar.com/events/1908/benevolent-order-of-the-creature-lodge-no-241"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Little Jumbo": "https://www.littlejumbobar.com/events/1908/benevolent-order-of-the-creature-lodge-no-241"}
X-SOURCE-ID:little_jumbo
SUMMARY:Benevolent Order of the Creature\, Lodge No. 241
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260728T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260728T200000
UID:f436a0b32f29f3e6a776d0dd9cfef1d9@littlejumbobar.com
DESCRIPTION:No one can say when the Lodge was founded\, only that the Crea
 ture was already in the corner when the columns went up\, when the paper s
 un was first hung and made to burn\, when the grass was cut from green sto
 ck and persuaded to grow. Four amber eyes\, arranged in no order known to 
 symmetry\, and a patience older than the room. It does not perform. It pre
 sides. The musicians are merely the part of the night that moves.\n\nMembe
 rship is not applied for. You are admitted the moment you stop noticing th
 e difference between the clouds overhead and the ceiling they hang from\, 
 the moment a held note outlasts the breath that started it and you forget 
 which one of you is dreaming the other. The Order keeps minutes from a mee
 ting that never adjourned. Its single bylaw is sympathetic vibration: stri
 k...
LOCATION:Little Jumbo: 241 Broadway St.\, Asheville\, NC 28801
URL:https://www.littlejumbobar.com/events/1908/benevolent-order-of-the-cre
 ature-lodge-no-241
X-SOURCE:Little Jumbo, Where Y'at AVL Music
END:VEVENT
