DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260802T083000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260802T103000
SUMMARY:AMC Sunday Ecstatic Dance w/ DJ Kristikka
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, August 2nd\n\n1st Danc
 e Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance 
 Wave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nDJ Kristi
 kka\n\nIntention: TBA\n\n## About DJ Kristikka\n\nKristikka (Kris Hostikka
 ) loves creating a sacred container that takes you on an inward journey ut
 ilizing rhythm to move us from quiet embodiment to chaos and down into sti
 llness and integration. She feels that movement is medicine\, weaving inte
 ntion and a rich blend of world beats where it’s possible to be with wha
 t is and open to what wants to be seen\, felt and moved. You can find her 
 dance mixes here:[ ](http://soundcloud.com/dj-kristikka) [http://soundclou
 d.com/dj-kristikka](http://soundcloud.com/dj-kristikka)\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\
 *\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptl
 y at Opening Circle and people who arrive late will be turned away. Please
  be on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\n\nTicket Price:
  $15-30 or name your price.\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\n\n\\~\
 \~\\~\n\nPre-registration Recommended:\nFirst Wave: [https://ashevillemove
 mentcollective.org/uqbb](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/uqbb)\nSe
 cond Wave: [https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/6r3x](https://ashevill
 emovementcollective.org/6r3x)\n\nVOLUNTEER!\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer
  and dance for free! Register to volunteer at: [https://ashevillemovementc
 ollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/voluntee
 r/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExVTF6aExURExqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkED
 IyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR6puHJaet_dJGFESCItA4rMD5vM_RHt9QzUSALulddRTAtGKexR
 uWuiBE8tDw_aem_vXP_JSWUu1NrAFuKa--PQA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\nDoor w
 ill close at the beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AF
 TER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevil
 lemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.o
 rg/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExVTF6aExURExqbndxM3JFUHNydGM
 GYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR5CSyB7238bGlkEsU_Cg_jsh0446YHLe69W1y3KV
 5-T6oMaN-7Z3q32wDznUA_aem_wUhim1G2JnrnWxIQYKCcIA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville
  Movement Collective envisions a world that moves in harmony where all are
  free to be their authentic selves within a loving community. Our mission 
 and aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy community through free-for
 m dance by hosting dance waves for personal and community transformation. 
 AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amcdance/events/315188355/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260609T205154Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260609T205154Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
