DESCRIPTION:Join the Dry Ridge Museum in welcoming Annelle Saunooke Clapsa
 ddle.Ms. Clapsaddle will discuss her acclaimed debut novel Even As We Brea
 the\, based on the history of the Grove Park Inn during WWII. Worlds colli
 de as a young Cherokee man interacts with detained AXIS Diplomats.
LOCATION:Albert Weaver Room\, Weaverville Community Center\, 60 Lakeshore 
 Dr\, Weaverville
