SUMMARY:Storytelling Event &#8211\; All Stars
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260813T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260813T200000
UID:tribe-16004@weavervillenc.org
DESCRIPTION:Gather with us for an evening of storytelling onThursday\, Aug
 ust 13\, at 7:00 PMat the Weaverville Community Center! Our talented local
  storytelling group will take the stage\, sharing a variety of engaging ta
 les that are sure to entertain\, inspire\, and spark your imagination. Whe
 ther you enjoy humorous yarns\, heartfelt stories\, or Appalachian traditi
 ons\, there’s something for everyone. Come experience the timeless art o
