DESCRIPTION:Pilates & Prayer is a Christian-focused women’s Pilates mat 
 class rooted in community and connection for women who love fitness and fa
 ith. This class is free to attend\, and each month we support and highligh
 t a local Asheville charity as a way to give back together.All levels are 
 welcome. We move to worship and Christian contemporary music in a groundin
 g\, restorative flow designed to calm the nervous system\, improve mobilit
 y\, stretching\, and build full-body strength.We open and close in prayer\
 , 
