DESCRIPTION:MaggieCrisp leads this Tuesday morning strength-based High Int
 ensity Interval Training (aerobic intervals). This offering is geared to m
 eet the needs for all fitness levels. You should bring a mat and plan to p
 rimarily engage in body weight exercises.The class is about 40 minutes\, a
 nd open to anyone 15+\, parental permission required for minors.Classes ar
 e held in the Albert Weaver Room on Tuesday and Thursday mornings from 8:0
 0 – 8:40 AM.Since the equipment is provided and brought from offsite p
LOCATION:Albert Weaver Room\, Weaverville Community Center\, 60 Lakeshore 
