UID:d10d15b1f7a3e39d4bcd239345f2e3bc@asheville.com
DESCRIPTION:Cost: $20\, kids under 3 FREE | Recurring on selected dates. A
 sheville Plays is thrilled to announce the return of the 14th Annual Haunt
 ed Trail\, Asheville's favorite family-friendly Halloween tradition! Desig
