DESCRIPTION:The Town Council will meet in a work session format to review a
 nd approve the proposed agenda for the upcoming regular monthly meeting th
 at is held the second Monday of each month (unless otherwise noted). This 
 meeting is open to the public\, but public comments are generally not acce
 pted at these meetings. To view draft agenda for an upcoming regular meeti
